CORE
contract.sol
--contract St --solidity-path-coverage --solidity-max-tx 1 --path-cov-assert spec.json
^--path-cov-assert: POST-STATE ASSERTION LADDER for unit 'f' path enc=2 depth=1 over 2 region bound\(s\)
^--path-cov-assert: bal: post == pre  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: bal: post != pre  HOLDS$
^--path-cov-assert: bal: post >= pre  HOLDS$
^--path-cov-assert: bal: post <= pre  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: bal: post > pre  HOLDS$
^--path-cov-assert: bal: post < pre  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: return: a value IS returned on this path \(REFUTED == yes\)  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: return: return == 0  REFUTED
^--path-cov-assert: return: return != 0  HOLDS$
^--path-cov-assert: ladder summary -- 9 candidate\(s\): 4 HOLDS, 5 REFUTED, 0 no verdict \(solver unknown\), 0 no verdict \(never reached the solver\)
